<title>UK: UK CLEARS ABBEY NATIONAL BUY OF CATER ALLEN.</title>
<headline>UK CLEARS ABBEY NATIONAL BUY OF CATER ALLEN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Department of Trade and Industry said on Monday it had decided not to refer Abbey National Plc's planned acquisition of Cater Allen Holdings Plc to the Monopolies and Mergers Commission.</p>
<p>Abbey National, which ranks among Britain's top five banking groups, said in June it would buy the financial services group.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
